WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:05.752
Marking staff attendance

00:00:05.802 --> 00:00:13.191
Open HR and Staff, then Attendance. The page opens on today with every staff member unmarked.

00:00:16.507 --> 00:00:19.816
Press Mark All Present to start from a full day.

00:00:20.674 --> 00:00:22.973
Change Bilal to Absent.

00:00:25.227 --> 00:00:30.270
Change Kamran to Late. Check in and check out times are optional.

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:35.518
Press Save All. Attendance is saved for every staff member.

00:00:38.869 --> 00:00:45.797
Open the Summary tab to see the month for each staff member: present, absent, late and the attendance rate.

00:00:49.284 --> 00:00:53.964
Attendance saved
